id: BUILD-029
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Misconfigured tsconfig include may pull test files into production build
category: build
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: tsconfig.json
  exclude_paths: node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: include
patterns:
  - regex: "include".*test
    message: "tsconfig include references test directory — test files may be compiled into production build output"
  - regex: "include".*spec
    message: "tsconfig include references spec files — test specs may be compiled into production build output"
  - regex: "include".*__tests__
    message: "tsconfig include references __tests__ — test files may be compiled into production build output"
fix: Create a separate tsconfig.build.json that excludes test directories. Use it for production builds.
